1783615416096606	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExnQM		item.create	bn-fyo	{"description":"A worker's 'cargo kani -p mess-index --harness ptr_block_round_trips_bounded' ran 9+ hours at ~9GB RSS (cbmc/cadical SAT blowup) and had to be identified as an orphan; varint_round_trips is fine. Before the Kani lane can be part of any CI story, tighten this harness's bounds (or restructure: smaller entry counts, kani::unwind annotations, constrained ptr deltas) so it completes in minutes. Until then workers should NOT run this harness — it wedges the machine (swap exhaustion).","kind":"task","labels":["verification"],"title":"Kani harness ptr_block_round_trips_bounded blows up (9h+, 9GB cbmc)"}	blake3:eLi_UFPl3DP2lmvcr6eoj2seMsNLXSGwnZPeFfbsdgw
